      "parameters": {
        "content": "# STEP 3 • MULTI-PLATFORM PUBLISHING\n\nVideo is uploaded to Blotato and then sent to enabled social publishing branches.\n\n### Configure\n- `BLOTATO_API_KEY`\n- required social account IDs\n\nSupported branches:\nInstagram, YouTube, TikTok, Facebook, Threads, X, LinkedIn, Bluesky, Pinterest.\n\nTest each enabled platform separately before production.",
        "height": 760,
        "width": 1200,
        "color": 4
      },
      "id": "cd9fc289-9f1d-43a6-8d0b-13569590556a",
      "name": "NOTES • Step 3 Social Publishing",
