      "typeVersion": 1
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "# BUYER SETUP GUIDE\n\n### Required\n- n8n\n- Google Sheets\n- OpenAI / configured LLM\n- Veo3 access through the configured generation endpoint\n- Blotato account + API key\n- Social accounts for the platforms you enable\n\n### Environment variables\n- `VIDEO_CONTENT_SHEET_ID`\n- `VIDEO_CONTENT_SHEET_NAME`\n- `VIDEO_CONTENT_NICHE`\n- `OPENAI_MODEL`\n- `BLOTATO_API_KEY`\n- `SOCIAL_INSTAGRAM_ID`\n- `SOCIAL_YOUTUBE_ID`\n- `SOCIAL_THREADS_ID`\n- `SOCIAL_TIKTOK_ID`\n- `SOCIAL_FACEBOOK_ID`\n- `SOCIAL_FACEBOOK_PAGE_ID`\n- `SOCIAL_X_ID`\n- `SOCIAL_LINKEDIN_ID`\n- `SOCIAL_PINTEREST_ID`\n- `SOCIAL_PINTEREST_BOARD_ID`\n- `SOCIAL_BLUESKY_ID`\n\nUse only buyer-owned credentials. Test concept generation, Veo3 output, Blotato upload, one publishing branch, and Sheet updates before activation.\n\nWorkflow is inactive by default.",
        "height": 620,
        "width": 650,
        "color": 7
      },
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        2860,
        -1580
      ],
      "id": "26d3dfd8-068b-458e-a95d-4e8173f5f690",
      "name": "NOTES • Buyer Setup & Credentials"
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "# PUBLISHING SAFETY & LIMITATIONS\n\n### AI video\nGenerated scenes can be fictional. Review content when brand safety, factual accuracy or sensitive topics matter.\n\n### Multi-platform publishing\nThis workflow can publish automatically to several accounts. Keep a human review step for regulated, sponsored or sensitive content.\n\n### Permissions\nBlotato and each social platform require properly authorized accounts. Account IDs alone do not grant permission.\n\n### Veo3 processing\nVideo generation is asynchronous and processing time can vary. Monitor failed or delayed executions.\n\n### Queue handling\nGoogle Sheets acts as the content queue. Keep the `production`, row identifier and output fields consistent.\n\n### Real-person likeness\nDo not generate or publish a real person's likeness without appropriate authorization.\n\nDo not activate until the complete end-to-end test passes.",
        "height": 620,
        "width": 650,
        "color": 1
      },
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        3540,
        -1580
      ],
      "id": "c91205ed-e6ae-4b15-b90f-97da4b2d250b",
      "name": "NOTES • Publishing Safety & Limitations"
    }
